Network use
-----------

Section 13 of the AGPL applies to this project and is the reason it was chosen
over the GPL.  If you modify KinematiK and make it available to users over a
network — including by hosting it as a web application — you must offer those
users access to the Corresponding Source of your modified version, at no
charge, through a network server.

The Corresponding Source of the version hosted by the original author is
available at:

    <REPOSITORY URL>


